        </li>
        <li>
          Implemented <strong>automated testing</strong> and continuous integration practices to improve
          code reliability
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Technologies:</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="badge badge-neutral badge-sm">Node.js</span>
          <span class="badge badge-neutral badge-sm">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="badge badge-neutral badge-sm">MySQL</span>
          <span class="badge badge-neutral badge-sm">API Development</span>
          <span class="badge badge-neutral badge-sm">Financial Systems</span>
        </div>
      </div>
